  "description": "A term used to describe individuals, typically assigned male at birth, who express femininity in their appearance, behavior, or interests. It is often used in a derogatory or mocking manner in online communities, particularly in gaming and internet culture, to stereotype or belittle those who do not conform to traditional masculine norms.",
